  "description": "The anime will tell an original story set 15 years after the novel's story. It takes place at a fictional theater called Hollywood Tokyo in Harajuku, where members of the idol group \"Shonen Hollywood\" develop their talents with diligent work and studying. \n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)",
