        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b180091-FjDNh9D6QOpa.png"
        },
        "description": "He is one of the five members and the leader of the new rendition of 'Shounen Hollywood'. Before becoming a member of the group he used to be a delinquent, who dropped out of high school. Despite his former delinquent past he is far from stern and bad-natured. Ikuma likes to laze around and is quite the funny guy. Furthermore he has a hard time learning the dances the group is supposed to learn. He is greatly obsessed with 'Cat' (Hollywood Tokyo Theater's own pet owl) and wants to carry him on his shoulders at least once. His life motto is 'Rome wasn't built in a day'.\n",
