        },
        "description": "Kakeru is a hard-working boy who is a little awkward at times. He's also appears to not care much about girls, also saying that \"They don't really look at him\", which is in fact false, unbeknownst to him.\n\nHe is always thinking, thus spacing out often. He is not very assertive and goes with flow. He seems to have low self-confidence.\n",
