        "description": "One of the members of Shounen Hollywood. He can be really stubborn and likes to make fun of the other members.\nHe likes to make fun of other people, but he has got a short temper when people start making fun about him. Although he might look a bit lazy he takes being an idol seriously.\nHe has a big pride and he loves to sing. He becomes stoic and knowledgeable when it comes to music.\n(Source: Wikia)\n",
