        "description": "Kira is the youngest member of 'Shounen Hollywood' and a former child star. He has been going to auditions and castings starting from a very young age but despite loving the music and acting industry he's having a hard time finding himself. So he decides to take matter into his own hands so his acting won't be 'boring' anymore.\n",
