        "description": "Tomii is very passionate about the original 'Shounen Hollywood'. His big inspiration is Minoru Tomii, whom he shares a name with and who is one of the original Shounen Hollywood members. Both of them also grew up at the same orphanage called 'Yamabiko Friends'. Tomii is very easy-going, friendly, cheerful and passionate. Therefore the kids at the orphanage really look up to him. He wants to make the members' dreams come true.\n",
